            {
                "entry_id": "4926a223-88b8-3e42-af57-9c8cf55b2348",
                "word": "Bacon",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2555f141-516b-321a-89d4-bc516107e31a",
                        "entry_id": "4926a223-88b8-3e42-af57-9c8cf55b2348",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Nom de famille."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b8b7259-224f-4ae7-9b6e-cce9b21b28a8",
                                "sense_id": "2555f141-516b-321a-89d4-bc516107e31a",
                                "text": "Francis Bacon est un homme d'État et un philosophe anglais."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09b6c2ac-8fcd-47c0-a813-0a38bb2c1385",
                                "sense_id": "2555f141-516b-321a-89d4-bc516107e31a",
                                "text": "Francis Bacon est un peintre irlandais réputé pour ses triptyques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "919e8073-a95b-4ca1-ad2c-56fb161daa91",
                                "sense_id": "2555f141-516b-321a-89d4-bc516107e31a",
                                "text": "Ça fait des lustres qu’il y a un Bacon encadré dans les W.-C. de mes parents avec quelqu’un qui est sur des W.-C. justement, et à la Bacon, quoi, genre torturé et pas très ragoûtant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2342c252-08a6-4466-8f63-666e35f9755c",
                                "sense_id": "2555f141-516b-321a-89d4-bc516107e31a",
                                "text": "Tant mieux, car il s’agit d’un excellent film catastrophe réalisé par le créateur des séries Mr. Robot et Homecoming où l’on a plaisir à retrouver Julia Roberts, Ethan Hawke, Kevin Bacon et Mahershala Ali."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "a966d34e-977d-3493-b7e8-b14b7b0e30ea",
                "word": "bacon",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "267d05a3-d989-47d1-8a35-79c7b04491d6",
                        "entry_id": "a966d34e-977d-3493-b7e8-b14b7b0e30ea",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "bacons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f71ba1d4-da55-3f80-ae53-2ce651cb305e",
                        "entry_id": "a966d34e-977d-3493-b7e8-b14b7b0e30ea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Lard très maigre, fumé, salé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Boucherie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bceea3b0-8d2b-404c-8c95-2ae7dd7bad93",
                                "sense_id": "f71ba1d4-da55-3f80-ae53-2ce651cb305e",
                                "text": "Deux tranches de bacon (NdT : Lard fumé, spécial pour accommoder les œufs.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed16a4ec-ebbc-4b8c-bcb5-67265ca36672",
                                "sense_id": "f71ba1d4-da55-3f80-ae53-2ce651cb305e",
                                "text": "Pour nous, ce n'est pas une contradiction de servir ce plat sucré (au sirop d'érable) avec du bacon dans la même assiette, car nous trouvons qu'ils vont bien ensemble."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c6760b5-59c6-477c-b5d2-453dfadb924d",
                                "sense_id": "f71ba1d4-da55-3f80-ae53-2ce651cb305e",
                                "text": "Faites raidir les tranches de bacon dans une poêle antiadhésive. Ôtez du feu et laissez refroidir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc52b64a-4f31-43ee-87cc-2f7141afc425",
                                "sense_id": "f71ba1d4-da55-3f80-ae53-2ce651cb305e",
                                "text": "Tellement chaud cette semaine que je suis passé devant une porcherie et ça sentait le bacon."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45e97445-c10a-3b07-8d48-1a33cf21d8d2",
                        "entry_id": "a966d34e-977d-3493-b7e8-b14b7b0e30ea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Filet de porc fumé et maigre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee074cf5-511f-4e62-bb30-c052c63c7b82",
                                "sense_id": "45e97445-c10a-3b07-8d48-1a33cf21d8d2",
                                "text": "Le bacon français existe toujours, c'est un filet de porc fumé et maigre ; il ne désigne donc pas tout à fait la même partie du porc qu'en anglais."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b2285ec-40ca-44c8-a868-d526665958cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "a966d34e-977d-3493-b7e8-b14b7b0e30ea",
                        "target_lang_word": "bacon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bacon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0ae7a4c-9bad-3e7c-b6a3-073c60c0bee5",
                                        "entry_id": "4d4f1845-da26-30ca-9483-57cbedaa832b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cured meat from the sides, belly, or back of a pig."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "395c5632-ca2f-4505-83d7-469a78c4b1da",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ae7a4c-9bad-3e7c-b6a3-073c60c0bee5",
                                                "text": "They fried the fish with bacon and were astonished, for no fish had ever seemed so delicious before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51d9fc87-1581-4082-aa99-eca469010448",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ae7a4c-9bad-3e7c-b6a3-073c60c0bee5",
                                                "text": "For us the pig's the means, while bacon is the end / Providing gustatory heights to which we can ascend."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "966ec18a-868c-44eb-9e62-b087e263ce63",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ae7a4c-9bad-3e7c-b6a3-073c60c0bee5",
                                                "text": "Bacon is something that everybody is familiar with and most people grew up eating. It has a comfort aspect to it and a familiarity. It's also got an addictive aspect to it - that sweet and salty combination of flavors. And it's probably just a little bit unhealthy for you. When you get to have bacon, it's exciting and something you look forward to."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec9cd7e0-2788-3013-8e08-b479d4affe25",
                                        "entry_id": "4d4f1845-da26-30ca-9483-57cbedaa832b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Thin slices of the above in long strips."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03a8dbb2-c8cc-4170-9496-cfb63e79cab8",
                                                "sense_id": "ec9cd7e0-2788-3013-8e08-b479d4affe25",
                                                "text": "As mesmerizing as it is to watch Kristen Kish whip up bacon and cinnamon waffles with boysenberry and strawberry jam, imagine playing poker with Hosea Rosenberg."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3270c39b-4a58-3169-8d7b-2fd2160bfc5d",
                                        "entry_id": "4d4f1845-da26-30ca-9483-57cbedaa832b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The police or spies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f66db11e-b8c4-49e9-9f24-6b59495b87ee",
                                                "sense_id": "3270c39b-4a58-3169-8d7b-2fd2160bfc5d",
                                                "text": "Run! It's the bacon!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "afc64e30-8f44-36f5-9839-a728ec3623c0",
